[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 1321.59, "timestamp": "00:22:01", "text": "啊，是的，首先是蘑菇。我們幸運嗎？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1324.95, "timestamp": "00:22:04", "text": "唉，我們真不走運。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1333.909, "timestamp": "00:22:13", "text": "首先，蘑菇不好。不，沒關係。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1343.43, "timestamp": "00:22:23", "text": "它只是普通的蘑菇。那很糟糕。  沒關係。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1362.07, "timestamp": "00:22:42", "text": "[音樂]"}]